A recommendation is a category-B-recommendation and is an evidence-type-3-recommendation.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid-pain-medication with a benzodiazepine then the clinician should particularly prescribe the opioid-pain-medication with the benzodiazepine cautiously.
If a clinician prescribes an opioid with a central-nervous-system-depressant then the clinician should weigh a benefit against a risk.
